    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74835" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρει-τρεφής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mountain-bred,
				mountain-fed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.34
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tryph.
					193
				</span></i>
			 :—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρεί-τροφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, βοτά</span>”
