					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					151
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>. [Both are freq. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀριτρ-</span> in codd., and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρίτροφος</span> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				106.3
			</span></i>.]</div>
